{"id":"a8fad09f2abacecd","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-axiomatization.md","title":"Axiomatization","display":"df-axiomatization — Axiomatization","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-axiomatization","aliases":["92-df-axiomatization"],"display":"df-axiomatization — Axiomatization","depends_on":["[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-theory-closure]]"],"source":"第 V 章 p. 57（PDF 74）","source_status":"本地理论公理化约定"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-axiomatization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-axiomatization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-axiomatization — Axiomatization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"668e712bdadc015a\" href=\"?note=668e712bdadc015a\" title=\"92-df-theory-closure\">92-df-theory-closure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 V 章 p. 57（PDF 74）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"本地理论公理化约定"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(A,T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> (sentence sets, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cn}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Cn}_G\\)</span> (consequence-closure operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"668e712bdadc015a\" href=\"?note=668e712bdadc015a\" title=\"92-df-theory-closure\">92-df-theory-closure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Axiomatizes}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Axiomatizes}_G\\)</span> (definition-target predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}axiomatization} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Axiomatizes}_G(A,T)\\Longleftrightarrow\nA\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\land T=\\mathrm{Cn}_G(A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}axiomatization} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Axiomatizes}_G(A,T)\\Longleftrightarrow\nA\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\land T=\\mathrm{Cn}_G(A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>公理化：用公理集生成理论</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T = \\mathrm{Cn}(A)\">\\(T = \\mathrm{Cn}(A)\\)</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>是<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>的推理闭包</li>\n<li>公理化可有限或无限</li>\n<li>有限公理化：有限个公理</li>\n<li>模式公理化：包含公理模式（无限但有规则）</li>\n<li>“有效可公理化”通常只要求存在c.e.公理集；若另要求公理成员关系可判定，可称递归公理集</li>\n<li>Gödel不完备性定理需要有效可公理化（c.e.已足够），并且还需要足够算术强度与相应一致性条件</li>\n<li>Craig技巧说明c.e.公理化的理论可改用一个递归公理集公理化；它改变公理呈现而不改变其闭包</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>本文件给任意句子集的公理化关系，不预设有效性。原书 axiomatizable 是定理码集 Σ₁；相关有效呈现必须另列，不可由有一个公理集合自动得到。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 V 章 p. 57（PDF 74）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-theory-closure","status":"resolved","id":"668e712bdadc015a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-theory-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G$ (sentence sets, see [[92-df-sentence]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-theory-closure","status":"resolved","id":"668e712bdadc015a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cn}_G$ (consequence-closure operator, see [[92-df-theory-closure]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cn}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Axiomatizes}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}axiomatization} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Axiomatizes}_G(A,T)\\Longleftrightarrow\nA\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\land T=\\mathrm{Cn}_G(A)","display":true},{"tex":"T = \\mathrm{Cn}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":1640,"backlinks":[{"id":"2f9850d6fe4ddc35","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Axiomatizes}_G$ (axiomatization predicate, see [[92-df-axiomatization]])"},{"id":"5085cfd35249f6d3","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Axiomatizes}_G$ (axiomatization predicate, see [[92-df-axiomatization]])"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-25","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-axiomatization]]"}],"outgoing":["90f32e29c9d553ed","668e712bdadc015a"]}